# Two smp bots duel on a flat world. The camera is moved next to the fight before every capture.
gamemode spectator Viewer
time set noon
weather clear
bot spawn Alpha smp expert at 0.5 -60 0.5
bot spawn Bravo smp skilled at 9.5 -60 0.5
tp Viewer 5.0 -57.5 -7.5 0 18
sleep 5
shot smp-duel-01-spawned
bot duel Alpha Bravo
sleep 5
execute at Alpha run tp Viewer ~3.5 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Alpha eyes
sleep 1
shot smp-duel-02
sleep 3
execute at Alpha run tp Viewer ~3.5 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Alpha eyes
sleep 1
shot smp-duel-03
sleep 3
execute at Bravo run tp Viewer ~-3.5 ~2.5 ~-5 facing entity Bravo eyes
sleep 1
shot smp-duel-04
sleep 4
execute at Alpha run tp Viewer ~3.5 ~3 ~-6 facing entity Alpha eyes
sleep 1
shot smp-duel-05
bot stats Alpha
bot stats Bravo
sleep 1
